---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Nations & Cultures
section: Lore
summary: The sixteen nations of Aeledd, from flood-carved Aluvair to the mist-shrouded remains of Eltiel.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="shell">
  {% include "partials/sidebar.njk" %}
  <main data-pagefind-body data-pagefind-meta="section:Lore">
    <p class="crumb"><a href="/lore/">Lore</a></p>
    <h1>Nations &amp; Cultures</h1>
    <p class="lede">Sixteen nations claim the known parts of Aeledd — though much of the world
    remains wilderness between them. Select a nation on the map or browse the cards below.</p>
    {% include "partials/world-map.njk" %}
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--nations">
      {% for n in collections.nations %}
      <a class="card card--nation" href="{{ n.url }}" style="--nation-color: {{ n.data.color }}">
        <h2>{{ n.data.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ n.data.summary }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
